            <div xml:id="d669">

                <pb facs="0774" n="672" sameAs="frus:frus1919v01/pg672"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">693.119/281: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Reinsch</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-08-30T17:00:00+08:00"><hi rendition="#italic">August 30,
                                1919, 5 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[<hi rendition="#italic">Received
                            August 30, 4.36 p.m.</hi>]</dateline></opener>
                <p>Chinese Government inquires of the Diplomatic Corps whether the embargo on arms
                    and ammunition includes raw material for the manufacture of the same. I have the
                    honor to request your instructions.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Reinsch</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
